B.3 Directed edges

```lean
def DirectedEdge : TLSACEVertex → TLSACEVertex → Prop
  | G,   Ad  => True
  | Ad,  Aex => True
  | C,   Aex => True
  | R,   Aex => True
  | C,   B   => True
